.el .ds Aq '
.TH rayscan-scripts-install 1  "install " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-scripts\-install \- Install a pack directory, archive URL, or registry pack into the local library
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBinstall\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-\-sha256\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISOURCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install a pack directory, archive URL, or registry pack into the local library
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Resolve SOURCE as a pack name from this registry index (or set RAYSCAN_SCRIPT_REGISTRY)
.TP
\fB\-\-sha256\fR \fI<HEX>\fR
Expected SHA\-256 digest of a direct archive URL (required for URLs)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing installed pack of the same name
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISOURCE\fR>
Pack directory, http(s) archive URL, or pack name with \-\-registry
